  "cases": [
    {
      "caseId": "sha256:f27baa7785471f47827e83a784bcd23e24f25e670847bcdd373de6e48bba926b",
      "localId": "jiuwudaishi:047:p040",
      "independentVerdict": "hold",
      "independentReason": "Hold jiuwudaishi:047:p040: Later Tang annals sovereign per_DE0VT6TBQHJB66G698FC (末帝) has missingBlockingName and no quotable primary Chinese name surface in chapter 047 sentences. Attribution rests on edict/approval claims (jiuwudaishi:047:s0079, jiuwudaishi:047:s0082, jiuwudaishi:047:s0092) where body text uses 帝/詔 without 末帝. Cross-chapter 末帝 mentions exist but are outside this case’s chapter-local person; retain accepted canonical membership without inventing witnesses. This is not a false merge or wrong-actor contradiction; it is a native primary-witness gap on a title-only sovereign surface.",
      "independentReport": "research/people/checkpoints/campaign-nov24-separate-transport-audited/jiuwudaishi-047/independent-identity-report-part-005.json @ 8b67cbd71cedd2ca3b41cc316de333114f95f499",
      "ownerDisposition": "remove-unnamed-placeholder-and-rehome (proposedChanges[0]); no name invented",
      "ownerFinding": "p040 is an extraction-chunk placeholder, not a separately witnessed person. Chunk 003 (s0072–s0103) contains no Chinese sovereign surface: no 末帝, and also no 帝, 上, 朕 or 陛下 (the review's \"uses 帝/詔\" is accurate only for 詔). The sovereign appears only as the unexpressed subject of 從之 (s0079), 詔 (s0082, s0092, s0097) in the 4th–5th months of 清泰二年. Its single name entry 末帝 is strongly-inferred, cited at s0079 「從之。」 and s0082, which do not contain it, and fails native assertDossierPrimaryWitness. The same reigning sovereign of the same annal is the established local p023 (帝 explicit at s0050 「帝召學士馬裔孫謂曰」, addressed as 陛下 at s0044; the annal opens 「清泰二年春正月丙申朔，帝御明堂殿受朝賀」 at s0001). The person has established primary evidence; only the duplicate record lacks it. The placeholder also carried the wrong year: its dated claims say AD 934, but 清泰二年 is AD 935 (corrected in the moved claims).",
