      "candidateSha256": "sha256:dcdeade6bb0f53a9426df1df583905fa57ff33db3c8cbc97d05d680e1d9a668e",
      "summary": "Remove the unnamed chunk-003 sovereign placeholder p040, re-home its thirteen subject claims and its strongly-inferred ruler role onto the established same-chapter sovereign p023, correct the five moved dated attestations from AD 934 to AD 935, and drop its misattributed 末帝 name entry.",
      "rationale": "Every p040 act is an annal act of the reigning Later Tang sovereign of 清泰二年 with an unexpressed subject; p023 is that sovereign in the same annal with explicit 帝 and 陛下 witnesses. 清泰二年 is AD 935 (s0001 heads the annal; chunk 003 follows 三月 at s0027 and precedes 六月 at s0104), within p023's AD 934-935 hint. The ruler role keeps its strongly-inferred certainty as a separate row. No name is added to p023.",
      "targetChoice": "The chapter represents its reigning sovereign as one 帝 local per extraction chunk: p001 (chunk 001, s0001–s0026), p023 (chunk 002, s0032–s0071), p040 (chunk 003), p092 (chunk 005) and p133 (chunk 006); accepted possible-same-as decisions already link p001, p023, p092 and p133. Only p040 lacks a primary witness. p023 is chosen because it is the record of the immediately preceding chunk, ending at s0071 adjacent to chunk 003, in the same 清泰二年 spring sequence; it holds the explicit ruler role, its AD 934-935 hint covers the corrected AD 935 rows, and its approved case has witnesses (陛下 s0044, 帝 s0050).",
      "sourceCitations": [
        {
          "unit": "jiuwudaishi:047:s0001",
          "zh": "清泰二年春正月丙申朔，帝御明堂殿受朝賀，仗衛如式。"
        },
        {
          "unit": "jiuwudaishi:047:s0027",
          "zh": "三月戊戌，故太子太保趙鳳贈太傅。"
        },
        {
          "unit": "jiuwudaishi:047:s0044",
          "zh": "逢陛下惟新之運，是文明革弊之秋，臣請應內外所管軍人，凡勝衣甲者，請宣下本部大將一一考試武藝短長，權謀深淺。"
        },
        {
          "unit": "jiuwudaishi:047:s0050",
          "zh": "帝召學士馬裔孫謂曰：「史在德語太凶，其實難容。"
        },
        {
          "unit": "jiuwudaishi:047:s0072",
          "zh": "夏四月辛巳，宰臣判三司張延朗奏：「州縣官征科條格，其令錄在任征科，依限了絕，一年加階，兩年與試銜，三年皆及限了絕，與服色。"
        },
        {
          "unit": "jiuwudaishi:047:s0079",
          "zh": "從之。"
        },
        {
          "unit": "jiuwudaishi:047:s0082",
          "zh": "詔其新編敕如可施行，付御史台頒行。"
        },
        {
          "unit": "jiuwudaishi:047:s0092",
          "zh": "乙巳，詔：「天下見禁囚徒，自五月十二日以前，除十惡五逆、放火燒舍、持仗殺人、官典犯贓、偽行印信、合造毒藥並見欠省錢外，罪無輕重，一切釋放。」"
        },
        {
          "unit": "jiuwudaishi:047:s0097",
          "zh": "詔曰：「偏旁文字，音韻懸殊，止避正呼，不宜全改。"
        },
        {
